<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TECHNIHIRE TALKS CONTINUE, URGES CAUTION.</title>
<headline>TECHNIHIRE TALKS CONTINUE, URGES CAUTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technihire Ltd said it was continuing talks which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>A company notice warned shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no futher details.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom -27-11-482.1003</p>
</text>
